<title>USA: Woodford Cty, Ky., won by Ross Sinclaire.</title>
<headline>Woodford Cty, Ky., won by Ross Sinclaire.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ross Sinclaire &amp; Associates, Inc. said it won $7.675 million of Woodford Cty SDFC, Ky., school building revenue bonds, Series 1996 B, with a net interest cost of 5.498 percent.</p>
</text>
